{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年間支えてくださった全ての方へ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年はお世話になりました\n2013年もよろしくお願いしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も濃ゆい1年間だった！\nデビューイヤーとなりましたねーとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長々と振り返ろうと思ってたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は2日ほど前から熱が下がらず\nちょっと、ちょーっと辛いので(小声)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとあれですねー\nライブが無事に終わって\nほっとしたんかなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって単純だからさー。ね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ほんとに\nただの風邪だから心配しないでねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会までには100%復帰するからねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は第10レーンで\nみさみさおねえたまと一緒だよー\nわーいわーい∩^ω^∩★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年やり残した\nひめたんツリーさんの写真を貼る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-全身-"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2012/12/31/2872212/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-アップ-"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2012/12/31/2872212/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作りがちゃっちーなあーとか\n触れちゃだめよ(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベルなんて鳴らないわよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで\n今年最後の記事が短くてごめんなさいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、くれぐれも\n体調にはお気を付けて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いお年を！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}